<title>FRANCE: Bertrand Faure Q3 sales up 15.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Bertrand Faure Q3 sales up 15.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				     3,056    up 15.2 pct</p>
<p>    Nine-month turnover		     10,279    up 11.1 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Car parts manufacturer Bertrand Faure issued its half-year results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
